00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.190
^- So Chris, you're the only one here

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:36.093
^who has seen the movie.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:37.830
^What are we getting into?

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:38.663
