00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:40.420
It's somewhat based on a true story.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.970
The police report I guess was like the first time.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:44.250
- There was a police report?

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.400
- There was a police report.
- No.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.610
- He actually like used paranormal

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.030
as like his reasoning for the case

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:52.293
so that makes it like kind of legit.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.180
^- I'm scared of like the supernatural side,

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.230
^the side you can't see--

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.063
^- Same, because you--
- Because you

00:00:57.063 --> 00:00:57.896
can't fight that!

00:00:57.896 --> 00:00:58.729
- Exactly.
- You can't fight that!

00:00:58.729 --> 00:00:59.562
- You can fight a serial killer,

00:00:59.562 --> 00:01:01.710
