00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:02.990
- That's what I'm saying!
- a werewolf.

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:04.460
- I don't (beep) with animals.
- The supernatural...

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:07.900
No, supernatural, no human can like deal with that.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.010
^- I don't like the idea of being possessed.

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:13.609
^'cause it's like, you're your own worst enemy at that point.

00:01:13.609 --> 00:01:15.100
That's one of my biggest fears, quite honestly.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.450
- So, we're all wearing heart rate monitors right now.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:19.460
Aren't they great?

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.160
We will be checking in during the movie

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.970
