00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.650
Why do most people die?

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:05.650
They die 'cause they're like

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.840
oh my God, my husband something's wrong with him,

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.220
let me go check on him.

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.500
What you gotta do, is run away.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.900
That's why I would survive like a zombie apocalypse.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.860
Because the second someone's acting weird

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.160
I'd be like,
- Yeah, I'm out.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.010
